          "tip": {
            "ref": "quadratic-function-properties#definition",
            "resource": "parabola-sign-grid",
            "note": "本题 $a^2-1=0$ 有两个解：$a=1$ 时变成 $-1<0$，成立；$a=-1$ 时变成 $2x-1<0$，不恒成立，舍去。"
          },
          "title": "讨论 a²−1 = 0",
          "position": 2
        },
        "d_position": {
          "refs": [
            "quadratic-function-properties",
            "quadratic-function-properties#zeros"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "quadratic-function-properties#zeros",
            "resource": "parabola-sign-grid",
            "note": "本题要 $f(x)<0$ 恒成立：开口向下（$a^2-1<0$），且与横轴没有公共点，相切也不行。"
          },
          "title": "判断图像位置",
          "position": 3
        },
        "d_delta": {
          "refs": [
            "quadratic-equation#discriminant",
            "method-discriminant#conditions",
            "quadratic-function-properties#zeros"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "quadratic-function-properties#zeros",
            "resource": "parabola-sign-grid",
            "note": "本题不带等号，只取 $\\Delta<0$：$\\Delta=(a-1)^2+4(a^2-1)=5a^2-2a-3<0$。"
          },
          "title": "建立判别式条件",
          "position": 4
        },
        "d_range": {
          "refs": [
            "quadratic-inequality-solve"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "quadratic-inequality-solve",
            "resource": "quadratic-sign-reading",
            "note": "本题 $5a^2-2a-3=(5a+3)(a-1)<0$，取两根之间：$-\\frac35<a<1$；再与前提 $-1<a<1$ 取交集，仍是 $-\\frac35<a<1$。"
          },
          "title": "求参数范围",
          "position": 5
        },
        "d_merge": {
          "refs": [
            "method-discriminant#merge"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "method-discriminant#merge",
            "resource": "case-merge-union",
            "note": "本题情况①只留下 $a=1$，情况②得 $-\\frac35<a<1$；取并集得 $-\\frac35<a\\le1$。"
          },
          "title": "合并两种情况",
          "position": 6
        },
        "d_boundary": {
          "refs": [
            "function-range-extrema#attainability"
          ],
          "tip": {
            "ref": "function-range-extrema#attainability",
            "resource": "attainability-boundary",
            "note": "本题 $a=-\\frac35$ 时左边是 $-\\left(\\frac45x-1\\right)^2$，在 $x=\\frac54$ 处等于 $0$，排除；$a=1$ 时是 $-1<0$，保留。"
          },
          "title": "检查边界",
          "position": 7
        }
      },
      "label": "判别式法"
    }
  },
  "statement": "已知不等式 $(a^2-1)x^2-(a-1)x-1<0$ 恒成立，求实数 $a$ 的取值范围。",
